{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f0b45847b93ef70d78239dbcd09316ea35d47830eb74f92872b0ec57277a0940", "ja": "（今日はパーティーに参加した。色々な\n出し物で盛り上がったけど、琴葉はどうだったかな？）", "zh": "（今天参加了派对。虽然各种节目让现场气氛十分热烈，但不知道琴叶感觉怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "f78dc46e09f3f199df66864388eac4720e70887398eb17cf9e171cf7e585a68f", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしてすみません。\n着替えに時間がかかってしまって……。", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了，真是对不起。\n换衣服花了点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1002_p", "source_sha256": "18f311b89c95b53e4abb1976f9302af94a6719be8e5478a334f4c1adb6de6960", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\nそれより、パーティーは楽しめたか？", "zh": "没事，不用在意。\n比起这个，派对玩得还开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "820226bf8b4ebf8654a32958bd7ae53d1448de5359fa4fd123074e0e07c78848", "ja": "はい！　会場もとても素敵でしたし、賑やかで\n楽しくて……時間が経つのもあっという間でした。", "zh": "是的！会场也非常棒，热闹又开心……不知不觉时间就过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1004_p", "source_sha256": "27ac744645acbcf6207463fcc084c602ae0406f6cbd9310508d9f2640a3ef7cb", "ja": "ああ、楽しいパーティーだったな。\nそういえば、さっき琴葉から預かった袋だけど……。", "zh": "啊，那真是一场愉快的派对。\n说起来，刚才从琴叶那里接过来的袋子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "7a18c1949ec7f82d44b97b50a51c81bbc590a7bb946dbc578573cec2502322c9", "ja": "あっ！　それは私が持ちます。", "zh": "啊！那个我来拿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "f16f76bd874a71aabb039f065257396307ee4ddeda79cd85d69e31b50447435d", "ja": "……あの、よければ\n{$P$}も一緒にどうですか？", "zh": "……那个，如果不介意的话，\n{$P$}要不要也一起来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "4d03b88a4155202d8cdc02251226b42ea2857974f28fe9fd891e58ff60f51938", "ja": "主催の方がビュッフェの料理を、\n持ち帰れるように手配してくれたんです。", "zh": "主办方特意安排了自助餐的料理，让我们可以带回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "f73c09d1cb0e24bd6c0dc9396e46314d9d826909c461ed5f0aa20b7f880828a0", "ja": "{$P$}は挨拶まわりで忙しいから、\nあまり食べられないんじゃないかって思って。", "zh": "我觉得{$P$}忙着到处打招呼，\n可能都没怎么吃上东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8b13a6e6d37a79a9c9ae50b2f7830a889fde8397513b6f43170da2aad80b19ad", "ja": "うっ……その通り。\nでもいいのか？　琴葉がもらったんだろう？", "zh": "唔……确实是这样。\n但我吃合适吗？那是给琴叶你的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "8af23757b2cd7ca641b15441eded2400b9621b4cb68936ff806f2dd2dc308ff4", "ja": "えっと、私のためじゃなくて……。美味しい料理を、\n{$P$}に食べてほしくて……。", "zh": "那个，我不是为了自己……是想让{$P$}尝尝好吃的料理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1012_p", "source_sha256": "66ef459ce4d30910547c8c559983227458a71b5a36cef4c6ac760e695940038b", "ja": "……琴葉、ありがとう。\nそれじゃあ、お言葉に甘えていただこうかな。", "zh": "……琴叶，谢谢你。\n那我就恭敬不如从命，开动咯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "7231017497602d59bb634f35402f863e99f27f60074172b6764acd26a19edd33", "ja": "はい。あの……\nせっかくですし、どこかで一緒に食べませんか？", "zh": "好的。那个……\n难得有这个机会，要不要找个地方一起吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "30d83e3f690be0006d89a57bff7044b335d89c78fcb93ea45781e619f487e5f7", "ja": "近くに大きな公園があるんです。\nよかったら、そこで……どうでしょうか？", "zh": "附近有一座很大的公园。要是不介意的话，去那里……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1015_p", "source_sha256": "209d79d5a7a0a39fc6f5768b5dee861db64a7663c14c70c3d1dc4e13a78e5858", "ja": "琴葉がいいなら、そこで構わないよ。\nもう少し付き合ってもらうことになるけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "只要琴叶觉得可以，在那里就行。\n不过还得再陪我一会儿，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0583_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "f1c3270688826a1033fca069b2f628088cba40e1487eba7ab13ed3341bd2ef83", "ja": "もちろんです。一緒に居られるだけで、疲れもどこかに\nいっちゃいますから。……な、なんて。ふふっ♪", "zh": "当然可以。只要能和你待在一起，疲劳什么的也会不知不觉消失……我、我说什么呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
